{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50227","headline":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 门扂 · 樊铸","name":"及第後读书院咏物[一]十首上礼部李侍郎 门扂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扃要政攸敦，防非道久尊。\n抡材矩已中，善闭契□存。\n只慎枢机动，宁矝开阖恩。\n自非蒙一拔，何得入龙门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"樊铸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50227.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50227","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}